			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"The Hoarfrost buried their dead in ice because ice keeps things, and a people who bury that"
				"carefully need someone whose entire life is the burying. Their grave-crews carried the"
				"Gravedigger and worked a rite over every interment."
				"The Convent never sealed it. You cannot bind a job."
				"So when the civilisation went under around CR 600 the crews went with it and the rite did not"
				"stop working. Lift the tool, do the work, and for as long as it takes you are the new gravedigger."
				"What answers is Palehand, and it does not arrive alone."
				"It answers the Gravedigger. Carry the tool, do the work, and it comes."
			]
