			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"He died wrong. The mummification-priest never arrived, the reagents were short, and the ritual"
				"ended with too much of him left intact. He began to walk, and his own priests sealed the Cursed"
				"Pyramid around him as containment. They fell within the year. The seal did not."
				"When the Desert collapsed and the Pyramid could no longer hold him, the Convent bound him a second"
				"time, north, in the Frosted Prison. Two buildings hold this king now: the Pyramid keeps what he was."
				"The Prison keeps what he refuses to be."
				"He will not be found. He has to be called, with the tablet the jailers left behind, which means the"
				"second seal is broken by whoever wants him dead. Killing him is not vengeance."
				"It is finishing the funeral his own people botched."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
